  "profile": "per generator: 50 clients, join to N/6 over 600 s, hold 900 s (17 stalled readers at 700 s for 60 s), leave to N/30 over 300 s, hold 60 s. The 4,500 step adds a second hold of 420 s after the first, during which the three nodes were restarted one at a time",
  "target": "during the 900 s hold (phase 2-hold): delivery p99 at most 1 s on every generator, at least 9.9 of the 10 offered messages/s acknowledged, no message lost or repeated",
  "note": "one fresh room per step, 4,500 first. 4,500 meets the target. 6,000 misses delivery p99 narrowly. At 10,000 two generators (on the machine of the room node) were saturated, so that step is not valid and is shown for reference only. Rolling restart at 4,500: each node restarted once, the next only after the previous reported serving and one heartbeat period passed",
  "not_shown": "a killed node, two nodes, a valid 10,000-client step",
